WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.875
Unit nineteen. Heat and Hydration!

2
00:00:04.836 --> 00:00:08.530
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:12.177
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.227 --> 00:00:16.152
Today we learn about Heat and Hydration. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:20.202
Heat. Say it with me. Heat!

6
00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:27.582
Hydration. Say it with me. Hydration!

7
00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:34.390
Water. Say it with me. Water!

8
00:00:37.882 --> 00:00:41.232
Shade. Say it with me. Shade!

9
00:00:44.716 --> 00:00:48.049
Dizzy. Say it with me. Dizzy!

10
00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.983
Headache. Say it with me. Headache!

11
00:00:58.483 --> 00:01:01.883
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

12
00:01:05.382 --> 00:01:08.582
Cool. Say it with me. Cool!

13
00:01:12.082 --> 00:01:20.428
Too much heat can make me dizzy or give me a headache. Good hydration means drinking water often. I rest in the shade and stay cool on hot days.

14
00:01:20.478 --> 00:01:21.635
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.853 --> 00:01:28.079
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.129 --> 00:01:29.279
Water!

17
00:01:30.085 --> 00:01:35.311
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:36.511
Rest!

19
00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:44.171
Did you know? Wearing light-coloured, loose clothes helps your body stay cooler in the sun!

20
00:01:44.221 --> 00:01:46.167
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.867 --> 00:01:54.421
Think and answer. What are signs your body is too hot?

22
00:01:54.471 --> 00:01:55.621
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.869 --> 00:02:01.764
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.814 --> 00:02:04.374
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

